your </span><span begin="03:01.150" end="03:01.690">back's </span><span begin="03:01.690" end="03:02.410">against </span><span begin="03:02.410" end="03:02.500">the </span><span begin="03:02.500" end="03:03.040">wall</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.090" end="03:08.020"><span begin="03:04.090" end="03:04.390">But </span><span begin="03:04.390" end="03:05.560">this </span><span begin="03:05.560" end="03:06.130">roaring </span><span begin="03:06.130" end="03:08.020">silence</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.470" end="03:10.960"><span begin="03:08.470" end="03:09.010">Won't </span><span begin="03:09.010" end="03:09.790">devour </span><span begin="03:09.790" end="03:10.030">us </span><span begin="03:10.030" end="03:10.960">all</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.150" end="03:21.220"><span begin="03:16.150" end="03:18.010">It's </span><span begin="03:18.010" end="03:19.960">a </span><span begin="03:19.960" end="03:20.470">freak </span><span begin="03:20.470" end="03:21.220">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:21.250" end="03:22.660"><span begin="03:21.250" end="03:21.955">Nothing's </span><span begin="03:21.955" end="03:22.660">familiar</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.660" end="03:26.020"><span begin="03:22.660" end="03:23.470">Nothing </span><span begin="03:23.470" end="03:23.860">seems </span><span begin="03:23.860" end="03:24.520">to </span><span begin="03:24.520" end="03:24.610">fit </span><span begin="03:24.610" end="03:24.820">into </span><span begin="03:24.820" end="03:24.880">the </span><span begin="03:24.880" end="03:25.270">scheme </span><span begin="03:25.270" end="03:25.600">of </span><span begin="03:25.600" end="03:26.020">things</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.950" end="03:32.500"><span begin="03:29.950" end="03:30.220">Seeing </span><span begin="03:30.220" end="03:30.880">faces </span><span begin="03:30.880" end="03:31.300">where </span><span begin="03:31.300" end="03:31.630">there </span><span begin="03:31.630" 